{
  "problem": {
    "title": "Two-Echelon Transshipment MIP with Fixed Station Costs",
    "description": "Minimize cost to ship containers from 2 production sites (S1 supply=100, S2 supply=150) through 2 intermediate stations (K1 cap=100 fixed=10, K2 cap=100 fixed=15) to 2 demand points (D1=80, D2=120). Per-unit shipping costs: site-to-station c1[S1,K1]=2, c1[S1,K2]=3, c1[S2,K1]=4, c1[S2,K2]=1; station-to-demand c2[K1,D1]=3, c2[K1,D2]=2, c2[K2,D1]=1, c2[K2,D2]=4. A station incurs its fixed cost only if it handles any flow (binary open variable linked to capacity).",
    "problem_type": "mixed_integer_programming",
    "objective": "minimize",
    "objective_description": "Total cost = sum(c1*flow1) + sum(c2*flow2) + sum(fixed_cost*open)",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "description": "Supply limit: total flow from site s to all stations <= supply[s]"
      },
      {
        "description": "Demand satisfaction: total flow to demand d from all stations >= demand[d]"
      },
      {
        "description": "Flow conservation at station k: inflow from sites = outflow to demands"
      },
      {
        "description": "Station capacity: total inflow to station k <= capacity[k] * open[k]"
      }
    ],
    "decision_variables": [
      "flow1[s,k]: continuous, units shipped from site s to station k (lb=0)",
      "flow2[k,d]: continuous, units shipped from station k to demand d (lb=0)",
      "open[k]: binary, 1 if station k is used"
    ],
    "parameters": [
      "supply[s]: production capacity of site s",
      "demand_req[d]: demand at demand point d",
      "capacity[k]: throughput capacity of station k",
      "fixed_cost[k]: fixed operating cost if station k is opened",
      "cost1[s,k]: per-unit shipping cost from site s to station k",
      "cost2[k,d]: per-unit shipping cost from station k to demand d"
    ],
    "additional_notes": "Expected obj=685. Optimal: S1->K1=100, S2->K2=100 (remaining 50 unused). K1->D2=100, K2->D1=80, K2->D2=20. Cost: c1(S1->K1)=200, c1(S2->K2)=100, c2(K1->D2)=200, c2(K2->D1)=80, c2(K2->D2)=80, fixed(K1)=10, fixed(K2)=15. Total=685. Flow conservation: flow_in[k]=flow_out[k] enforces station pass-through. Station capacity links flow to open binary via big-M=capacity[k].",
    "csv_file_paths": {
      "sets": "sets.csv",
      "supply": "supply.csv",
      "demand": "demand.csv",
      "station_params": "station_params.csv",
      "cost1": "cost1.csv",
      "cost2": "cost2.csv"
    }
  },
